OL,3,GNEWSAYoung drivers offered cash for
OL,4,Aenhanced training
OL,5,
OL,6,FA council is offering funding towards
OL,7,Fan advanced driving course in a bid to
OL,8,Freduce the number of young people
OL,9,Fkilled and seriously injured on the
OL,10,Froad.
OL,12,FWestmorland and Furness Council is
OL,13,Foffering a #150 subsidy towards the
OL,14,FPass Plus scheme aimed at developing
OL,15,Fyoung drivers' skills and confidence.
OL,17,FCabinet member Peter Thornton said
OL,18,Fyoung drivers were disproportionately
OL,19,Frepresented in road traffic collisions
OL,20,Fand the council hoped the scheme would
OL,21,F"make our roads safer for everyone."
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
