OL,3,GNEWSAYoung drivers offered cash for
OL,4,Aenhanced training
OL,5,
OL,6,FThose aged between 17 and 24 in the
OL,7,Flocal authority area who passed their
OL,8,Fpractical driving test within the last
OL,9,F12 months will be able to apply for the
OL,10,Fhelp.
